    <id>tag:github.com,2008:Repository/17728164/v1.16.6</id>
    <updated>2026-10-14T09:31:54Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" type="text/html" href="https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/releases/tag/v1.16.6"/>
    <title>v1.16.6</title>
    <content type="html">&lt;h2&gt;1.16.6 (October 14, 2026)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BUG FIXES:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;cloud: &lt;code&gt;terraform init&lt;/code&gt; can now find workspaces selected by key/value tags whose keys contain uppercase letters. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39306&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/hashicorp/terraform/pull/39306/hovercard&quot;&gt;#39306&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;test: Allow module under test to use deprecated outputs. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39207&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;issue&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39207/hovercard&quot;&gt;#39207&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;NOTES:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prevent a HTTP/2 resource exhaustion via CVE-2026-78669. Exploitation would require a compromised (untrusted) provider/module registry. Such a threat is considered to be outside the perimeter of Terraform core security guarantees. (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39375&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/hashicorp/terraform/pull/39375/hovercard&quot;&gt;#39375&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</content>
