&lt;p&gt;Fix handling of destroy=false around create_before_destroy instances (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39169&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/hashicorp/terraform/pull/39169/hovercard&quot;&gt;#39169&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Fix function result comparison when there are multiple marks (&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/hashicorp/terraform/issues/39170&quot; data-hovercard-type=&quot;pull_request&quot; data-hovercard-url=&quot;/hashicorp/terraform/pull/39170/hovercard&quot;&gt;#39170&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;
